                <title locale="en_US">Endemic Amphibians of the Sierra Madre Mountain Range</title>
                <abstract locale="en_US">This study surveys amphibian populations across elevational gradients in the Sierra Madre mountain range, documenting 23 species including 7 newly recorded endemics. Our findings highlight the critical conservation status of montane ecosystems.</abstract>
                <pages>1-15</pages>
