                <title locale="en_US">A Systematic Review of Coral Reef Restoration in the Coral Triangle</title>
                <abstract locale="en_US">We review 45 coral reef restoration projects across the Coral Triangle region, evaluating success metrics, methodology, and long-term survival rates. Restoration success varies significantly by method and location.</abstract>
